applying is the only way to use them at range. Likewise, whips for 
disarming. Unihorns are not wielded to apply. Other weapons cannot be 
applied.

Axes can be applied against trees and doors, pick-axes against walls, 
dirt, statues and boulders. It may be a bit questionable whether battle-
axes and mattocks, both effective weapons, should be insta-wielded like 
this.

